keymasq (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Improve macro replay timing by anchoring playback to monotonic deadlines
    and tightening daemon timer slack at startup.
  * Prefer uvloop for supported async runtimes to reduce event-loop
    overhead in the daemon, session broker, and CLI entrypoints.
  * Switch keymasqd startup ordering to udev-triggered dependencies and add
    benchmark and docs coverage for macro replay fidelity and autoclicker
    workflows.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Sat, 18 Apr 2026 02:15:47 +0000

keymasq (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keymasq.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

keymasq (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

